---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/feedback.css';
const root = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const api = (import.meta.env.PUBLIC_FEEDBACK_API_URL || '').replace(/\/$/, '');
const sitekey = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY || '';
const ready = /^https:\/\/[a-z0-9.-]+(?::\d+)?$/i.test(api) && sitekey.length > 10;
---
<BaseLayout title="讀者留言與建議" description="直接提出地方實踐指南新主題建議、網站回饋、補充經驗與內容勘誤；留言經審核後公開。">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="breadcrumbs"><a href={root + '/'}>首頁</a> / 讀者留言與建議</div>
      <span class="eyebrow">COMMUNITY FEEDBACK</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">讀者留言與建議</h1>
      <p>不必指定某篇文章，也能直接告訴我們希望新增哪些內容、分享實務經驗、提出問題或協助勘誤。所有留言經工作人員確認後才公開。</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section-spacer">
    <div class="wrap guide-feedback-feed-wrap">
      {ready ? (
        <div class="guide-feedback-feed" id="guide-feedback-feed" data-api={api} data-sitekey={sitekey} data-root={root}>
          <section class="guide-direct-panel" id="guide-feedback-direct" aria-labelledby="guide-direct-title">
            <div class="guide-direct-heading">
              <span class="eyebrow">YOUR VOICE, OUR NEXT CHAPTER</span>
              <h2 id="guide-direct-title">直接留言給編輯團隊</h2>
              <p>想增加什麼主題？哪個步驟還是不清楚？也歡迎提供網站使用上的建議。留言不必綁定任何一篇詞條。</p>
            </div>
            <form class="guide-direct-form" id="guide-direct-form" novalidate>
              <label class="guide-direct-field">
                <span>你想提出什麼？</span>
                <select name="topic_kind" id="guide-direct-kind" required>
                  <option value="topic">希望新增的主題</option>
                  <option value="site">網站使用建議</option>
                  <option value="question">提問諮詢</option>
                  <option value="supplement">補充經驗與案例</option>
                  <option value="correction">內容更正</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <label class="guide-direct-field">
                <span>稱呼（可留空）</span>
                <input name="author" maxlength="40" autocomplete="nickname" placeholder="例如：在地工作者"/>
              </label>
              <label class="guide-direct-field guide-direct-span" id="guide-direct-subject-wrap">
                <span>希望增加的主題名稱（選填）</span>
                <input name="subject" maxlength="80" placeholder="例如：如何籌辦社區課程、租借公共空間"/>
              </label>
              <label class="guide-direct-field guide-direct-span">
                <span>留言內容（至少 10 個字）</span>
                <textarea name="body" rows="5" minlength="10" maxlength="1800" required
                  placeholder="請具體描述想新增的內容、遇到的問題，或可以提供的經驗。"></textarea>
              </label>
              <div class="guide-feedback-trap" aria-hidden="true">
                <label>請勿填寫此欄 <input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></label>
              </div>
              <p class="guide-direct-notice">請勿填寫電話、住址、身分證字號或其他個人資料。留言會先由編輯團隊審核，公開後其他讀者也能看到。</p>
              <div class="guide-direct-submit-row">
                <div id="guide-direct-turnstile" class="guide-direct-turnstile" aria-label="安全驗證"></div>
                <button class="guide-feedback-primary" type="submit" data-direct-submit>送出留言，等待審核 ↗</button>
              </div>
              <p class="guide-feedback-message guide-direct-message" id="guide-direct-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
            </form>
          </section>
          <div class="guide-feedback-feed-intro">
            <span class="eyebrow">COMMUNITY NOTES</span>
            <h2>已公開的讀者留言</h2>
            <p>依「補充留言、提問諮詢、內容更正」分類。新主題與網站建議也收錄在「補充留言」欄中。</p>
          </div>
          <p class="guide-feedback-feed-status" data-feed-status role="status" aria-live="polite">正在讀取留言……</p>
          <div class="guide-feedback-categories" aria-label="依留言類型分類">
            <section class="guide-feedback-category" data-feedback-kind="supplement">
              <div class="guide-feedback-category-head">
                <span class="guide-feedback-category-symbol" aria-hidden="true">＋</span>
                <div><h2>補充留言</h2><p>實務經驗、案例、想新增的主題</p></div>
              </div>
              <p class="guide-feedback-category-count" data-kind-count></p>
              <div class="guide-feedback-category-list" data-kind-items></div>
              <button type="button" class="guide-feedback-category-more" data-kind-more hidden>顯示更多留言 ＋</button>
            </section>
            <section class="guide-feedback-category" data-feedback-kind="question">
              <div class="guide-feedback-category-head">
                <span class="guide-feedback-category-symbol" aria-hidden="true">？</span>
                <div><h2>提問諮詢</h2><p>釐清文章內容與實際問題</p></div>
              </div>
              <p class="guide-feedback-category-count" data-kind-count></p>
              <div class="guide-feedback-category-list" data-kind-items></div>
              <button type="button" class="guide-feedback-category-more" data-kind-more hidden>顯示更多留言 ＋</button>
            </section>
            <section class="guide-feedback-category" data-feedback-kind="correction">
              <div class="guide-feedback-category-head">
                <span class="guide-feedback-category-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
                <div><h2>內容更正</h2><p>需查證、更新或修正的內容</p></div>
              </div>
              <p class="guide-feedback-category-count" data-kind-count></p>
              <div class="guide-feedback-category-list" data-kind-items></div>
              <button type="button" class="guide-feedback-category-more" data-kind-more hidden>顯示更多留言 ＋</button>
            </section>
          </div>
          <details class="guide-feedback-diagnostic" id="guide-feedback-diagnostic" hidden>
            <summary>留言無法送出？檢查連線狀態</summary>
            <p>此檢查只測試服務是否連得上，不會儲存任何留言，也不會傳送個人資料。</p>
            <button class="guide-feedback-secondary" type="button" data-diagnostic-run>開始檢查連線</button>
            <pre class="guide-feedback-diagnostic-result" data-diagnostic-result role="status" aria-live="polite">尚未執行檢查。</pre>
            <p>若結果顯示跨網域連線失敗，請確認目前開啟的是 HTTPS 網址，並檢查 Worker 的 ALLOWED_ORIGINS 是否包含此頁面實際網址。</p>
          </details>

        </div>
      ) : (
        <div class="guide-feedback-standby"><h2>讀者留言功能正在準備中</h2>
          <p>我們正在建立留言保存與審核機制，目前尚未開放公開留言。本站的文章與知識百科仍可以正常閱讀。</p>
          <a class="text-link" href={root + '/knowledge/'}>返回知識百科 ↗</a>
        </div>
      )}
      {ready && <script src={root + '/scripts/feedback.js'} is:inline defer></script>}
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
